# DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Sequence Generation
# Difficulty: Advanced
# Concept: Working Sequences & Allocation
# Mode: Scholar (Latin transliteration)
#
# Purpose:
#   Demonstrates working sequence tablet allocation, appending entries,
#   and querying length, first, and last values.
#
# Expected Output:
#   6
#   1
#   8

problem
    working fib of length 0

    append 1 to fib
    append 1 to fib
    append 2 to fib
    append 3 to fib
    append 5 to fib
    append 8 to fib

    n : length of fib
    first_val : first from fib
    last_val : last from fib

result
    n
    first_val
    last_val
